  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core Support to Razumkov Centre</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till Razumkov Centre</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida will provide a grant for a pre-core support against a detailed   budget and an action plan. If the outputs of the pre-core support are delivered according to plan, Sida will provide core support. In this  intervention Sida both relies on the internal systems of the          organisation and helps the organisation to develop them further with  Sida&apos;s support.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sidas f&#xf6;rberedande st&#xf6;d ges i form av en g&#xe5;va mot en detaljerad       budget och en handlingsplan. Om prestationer av det f&#xf6;rberedande      st&#xf6;det levereras enligt plan, kommer Sida att ge organisationen       k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d. I denna insats Sida b&#xe5;de f&#xf6;rlitar sig p&#xe5; organisationens    interna system och hj&#xe4;lper organisationen att vidareutveckla  och     st&#xe4;rka dem med Sidas st&#xf6;d.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to the building of a democratic, ruled by law, socially-oriented European state in Ukraine, development of civil society, improvement of the quality of life of its citizens, enhancement of the international image of the Ukrainian state and attainment of its national interests.</narrative>
  </description>
